<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch16-14--grok--data-existence> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data existence of thompson1917-ch16-14 by Grok 4.7: 0.62";
